sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 求职者
    participant Controller as ResumeController
    participant Service as ResumeService
    participant Dao as ResumeDao
    participant FileService as FileStorageService
    participant Auth as 统一权限接口

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. 在线创建简历
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Auth: 在线创建简历
    User->>Controller: 填写简历信息<br/>(基础信息/教育/工作/技能/自我评价)
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Auth: 验证用户身份
    activate Auth
    Auth-->>Controller: 身份验证通过
    deactivate Auth

    Controller->>Service: 创建简历(简历DTO)
    activate Service
    Service->>Service: 数据校验与格式化
    Service->>Dao: 插入简历主表
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历ID
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 插入教育经历
    Service->>Dao: 插入工作经历
    Service->>Dao: 插入技能证书
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 返回创建成功及简历ID
    Controller-->>User: 显示简历创建成功
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. 编辑简历
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Dao: 编辑简历
    User->>Controller: 修改简历信息
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 修改简历(简历ID, 简历DTO)
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 查询原简历信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回原简历
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 更新简历主表
    Service->>Dao: 同步更新子表<br/>(删除旧记录+插入新记录)
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 更新成功
    Controller-->>User: 显示保存成功
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. 删除简历
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Dao: 删除简历
    User->>Controller: 选择简历并删除
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 删除简历(简历ID)
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 检查简历是否属于当前用户
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Dao: 逻辑删除简历<br/>(设置is_deleted=1)
    Service->>Dao: 关联删除子表数据
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 删除成功
    Controller-->>User: 确认删除
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. 预览简历
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Dao: 预览简历
    User->>Controller: 点击预览简历
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 预览简历(简历ID)
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 查询简历完整信息<br/>(含所有子表)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回完整简历数据
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Service: 组装简历视图模型
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 返回预览数据
    Controller-->>User: 展示简历预览页
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. 导出PDF
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Service: 导出PDF
    User->>Controller: 点击导出
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 导出简历(简历ID)
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 查询简历完整信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历数据
    deactivate Dao

    Service->>Service: 生成PDF文档
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 返回PDF文件流
    Controller-->>User: 下载PDF文件
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 6. 简历隐私设置
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, Dao: 简历隐私设置
    User->>Controller: 修改隐私设置<br/>(公开/仅企业可见/隐藏)
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 修改隐私设置(简历ID, 公开程度)
    activate Service

    Service->>Dao: 更新简历隐私字段
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 设置成功
    Controller-->>User: 保存成功
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 7. 附件上传
    %% ==========================================
    Note over User, FileService: 附件上传
    User->>Controller: 上传简历附件(PDF/Word)
    activate Controller

    Controller->>Service: 上传简历附件(简历ID, 文件)
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: 校验文件格式和大小
    Service->>FileService: 上传文件至OSS/本地存储
    activate FileService
    FileService-->>Service: 返回文件URL
    deactivate FileService

    Service->>Dao: 保存附件记录<br/>(文件名、URL、上传时间)
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>Controller: 返回附件信息
    Controller-->>User: 显示上传成功
    deactivate Controller